License & Attribution

================================================================================

本專案是基於日本免費遊戲「しょぼんのアクション」(Syobon Action / Cat Mario)
ver 0.80 的繁體中文化衍生作品。原作者保有所有原始智慧財產權。

This project is a derivative work based on the Japanese freeware game
"Syobon Action" (しょぼんのアクション / Cat Mario) ver 0.80,
released in 2007 by 「ちく」 (Chiku).

================================================================================
ORIGINAL WORK — © 2007 ちく (Chiku)
================================================================================

The following are property of the original author 「ちく」 and are
redistributed under the original freeware terms:

  - Game design, level design, and original gameplay mechanics
  - Engine code (main.cpp, main.h, loadg.cpp before translation)
  - All audio assets in BGM/ and SE/
    (castle.mp3, dungeon.mp3, field.mp3, puyo.mp3, star4.mp3,
     and all sound effects in SE/)
  - All graphics assets in res/
    (player.PNG, brock.PNG, brock2.PNG, haikei.PNG, item.PNG,
     omake.PNG, omake2.PNG, syobon3.PNG, teki.PNG)
  - Original Japanese text and story content

Original distribution terms (per the original _____.txt by 「ちく」)：

  > 不特定多数の人間に配布する場合には、著作者 ちく を明記して下さい。
  > 散布給不特定多數人時，請務必註明原作者「ちく」。

This redistribution complies with the original terms by clearly crediting
「ちく」 as the original author throughout the documentation, source
comments, in-game staff roll, and this LICENSE file.

================================================================================
MODIFICATIONS — © 2026 thc1006
================================================================================

The following modifications and additions are licensed under the MIT License
(see below):

  - Traditional Chinese (zh-TW) translation of all source code comments
    (351 comment lines in main.cpp, 42 in main.h, 24 in loadg.cpp)
  - Traditional Chinese localization of 92 in-game text strings,
    including PTT/Dcard-style internet slang adaptation (v2 localization)
  - New title screen image res/syobon3_v2.PNG
    (Chinese-language reskin; replaces res/syobon3.PNG which is preserved)
  - Build system: Dockerfile, Makefile, scripts/build-launcher.sh,
    scripts/setup-dxlib.sh, app.rc, icon.ico
  - Single-file portable launcher packaging (uses chrislake/7zsfxmm
    modified SFX module — see "Third-party tools" below)
  - Death counter system with progressive window-title taunts
  - Additional death messages in slots 56-65
  - Window icon embedded via Windows resource (.rc)
  - Encoding migration from CP932 (Shift_JIS) to UTF-8 with BOM
  - CRT and threading runtime fixes for 64-bit MinGW-w64 build
  - WinMain working-directory fix (GetModuleFileNameW + SetCurrentDirectoryW)
  - Defensive guards for missing audio files (oto[107] / last.mp3 case)
  - Compiler warning fixes (-Wparentheses, -Wmisleading-indentation)
  - Removal of 5 obviously-dead code blocks (J2ME/Java leftovers)
  - Documentation: README.md, BUILD.md, this LICENSE

The MIT License only applies to the modifications listed above. The
underlying game design, engine code, audio, and graphics remain the
property of the original author.

