================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY TOOLS USED IN BUILD (not redistributed in source form)
================================================================================

The following tools are used during build but are not part of this
repository's source tree (they are downloaded at build time or fetched
once into tools/):

  - DxLib by 山田巧: https://dxlib.xsrv.jp/
      Downloaded by scripts/setup-dxlib.sh; not redistributed in this repo.

  - 7zsd.sfx (Modified 7-Zip SFX module) by Oleg Scherbakov / chrislake:
      https://github.com/chrislake/7zsfxmm
      Stored in tools/7zsd.sfx for launcher packaging. Released under its
      own license (LGPL-style); see upstream repository.

  - Official 7-Zip 7z.sfx (extracted from 7-zip.org installer):
      Stored in tools/7z.sfx. © Igor Pavlov; LGPL.

